","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"130fae9e-6550-5334-86f6-36779112e62d"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.10.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.10.050","content_hash":"4877b470447ccc5eb856c4a5604f6c57bf44188f0190d36f784c153c58f89daa","heading":null,"ordinal":16,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:16","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.10.050","text":"(1) All signs (including any footings) for which a permit is required are subject to inspection by the Building Official.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"55ac9f34-9397-5883-82ea-7a2073f256b0"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"18.10.050","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.10.050","content_hash":"70d2d14ba5d10a199aad0fe1e2b47bc2674b797854cc85ddd37204978a5fae0a","heading":null,"ordinal":17,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:block:17","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/18.10.050","text":"(2) All signs containing electrical wiring are subject to all applicable provisions of the electrical code adopted by the City. (Ord. 20631 § 57, 1-13-26.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"da5af41f-a2a3-555f-a758-5a9358846f35"}],"root_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.050:section","schema":"exais.jurisdiction.structured_content.v1"}